codex
I’ve added a separate read-only probe for one concrete alternative: score each candidate answer through the base model’s pretrained “yes vs. no / correct vs. incorrect” directions, without generation or extra data. Once the reference finishes, I’ll measure that probe before committing to it; this distinguishes “the base representation already exposes knowledge” from “the new head must learn the bridge.”
