The reference has passed 80% of training and remains stable; the second epoch loss is around 0.4–0.5. I’ll record both probability quality and accuracy by source, because this task rewards NLL: an architecture that raises accuracy but becomes overconfident can still be worse, especially on MMLU-Pro and evidence-removed diagnostics.
