The reference public score is 0.2543 (macro NLL 1.369): other-domain NLL 0.838 is respectable, but knowledge NLL is 1.900, with only 15.5% on MMLU-Pro. The raw pretrained verbalizer is better calibrated on knowledge (best NLL ~1.81) but less accurate and much worse on other tasks, so it is useful as a residual signal—not a standalone replacement. I’m submitting the untouched reference now for the hidden aggregate.
